* Small-signal model of the source follower with resistor RF from gate to source (M1 on and saturated)
Vin in 0 {v_in}
RF in out {R_F}
RS out 0 {R_S}
* M1: drain at AC ground (VDD), gate at in, source at out, bulk at ground: v_gs = v_in - v_out, v_bs = -v_out
Gm 0 out in out {gm}
Gmb 0 out 0 out {gmb}
.end
